    "content": "All 23 checklist items have been executed and recorded — **16 PASS / 7 FAIL**.\n\nThe failures cluster into four themes:\n\n**Security / auth (most serious)**\n- **CS-12** — Passwords are never verified. Signing in as `emma@example.com` with a deliberately wrong password created a full authenticated session; the login page even advertises \"(any password works)\".\n- **CS-23** — `/cart` and `/create-listing` render a completely blank document when signed out instead of prompting or redirecting (broken router guard). The Add-to-Cart redirect and the \"Log in to message\" disabled button do work correctly.\n\n**Missing features**\n- **FT-2** — Listing editing does not exist at all; sellers only get View / Mark Sold / Delete.\n- **FT-1** — No file input anywhere; \"Add Photo\" only appends a fixed Unsplash stock image, so sellers can't attach their own photos. Everything else about listing creation worked.\n- **FT-6** — The \"Price Range\" slider has a single thumb that sets only a minimum; the $500 ceiling can't be lowered. All other filters and all four sorts were exact.\n\n**Broken wiring**\n- **FT-21** — Category cards on `/categories` navigate to `/?category=furniture` but the parameter is ignored, so all 8 items still show. The home page's own category tiles filter correctly, isolating the defect.\n- **FT-22** — Cart checkout toasts \"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\" and empties the cart while recording zero requests, and no seller-facing view of requests exists (the \"My Profile\" link 404s).\n\n**Two incidental observations** worth flagging to the developers, though outside the checklist's assertions: registered accounts and all listing changes are in-memory only and vanish on any page reload, and the `/profile` route 404s while still being linked from the user menu."
  }
